<title>USA: Children's Q3 Dec 31 full results.</title>
<headline>Children's Q3 Dec 31 full results.</headline>
<dateline>MURFREESBORO, Tenn. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			   December 31,	     December 31,</p>
<p>			    1996	1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p>Total revenues $8,164,000$ 6,204,000 $21,405,000 $17,398,000</p>
<p>Net income (1)</p>
<p>		     2,476,000    668,000   3,816,000   1,477,000</p>
<p>Fully diluted net income per</p>
<p>  share (1)	     0.34	 0.12	  0.58	  0.26</p>
<p>Fully diluted weighted average common shares and</p>
<p>equivalents</p>
<p>  outstanding    7,326,000  5,631,000   6,522,000   5,603,000</p>
<p>Note: (1) Results for the first nine months of fiscal 1997 contain a nonrecurring extraordinary charge of $448,000, or $0.07 per fully diluted share, related to the early retirement of debt, and a nonrecurring credit to income tax expense of $1,783,000, or $0.27 per fully diluted share, related to reversal of a portion of the valuation allowance against the Company's deferred tax assets.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
